<title>DENMARK: SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT SLOVENIA 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DENMARK BEAT SLOVENIA 2-1 IN EURO UNDER-21 QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>KOEGE, Denmark 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark beat Slovenia</p>
<p>2-1 (halftime 0-0) in a European under-21 soccer championship</p>
<p>group one qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Denmark - Martin Joergensen (66), Marc Nygaard (77)</p>
<p>Slovenia - Milan Osterc (72)</p>
<p>Attendance: 1,301</p>
<p>    Standings	 P  W  D  L  F  A   PTS</p>
<p> Greece		 6  4  1  1  7  3   13</p>
<p> Denmark		4  2  0  2  6  6    6</p>
<p> Croatia		5  2  0  3  5  6    6</p>
<p> Slovenia	     5  2  0  3  5  7    6</p>
<p> Bosnia		 4  1  1  2  3  4    4</p>
</text>
